{"id":"57d164c83dae12df","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-2-cover.md","title":"2-cover","display":"df-2-cover — 2-cover","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-2-cover","aliases":["58-df-2-cover"],"display":"df-2-cover — 2-cover","depends_on":["[[58-df-cover]]","[[58-df-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-2-cover"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-2-cover</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-2-cover — 2-cover"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a2427ac4523911c5\" href=\"?note=a2427ac4523911c5\" title=\"58-df-cover\">58-df-cover</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U \\subseteq \\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal U \\subseteq \\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> (cover family, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a2427ac4523911c5\" href=\"?note=a2427ac4523911c5\" title=\"58-df-cover\">58-df-cover</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TwoCover}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TwoCover}_S\\)</span> (predicate introduced here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}2\\text{-}cover} \\vdash \\mathrm{TwoCover}_S(\\mathcal U,X) \\leftrightarrow \\mathcal U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\forall a,b\\in X\\;\\exists U\\in\\mathcal U\\;(a\\in U\\land b\\in U)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}2\\text{-}cover} \\vdash \\mathrm{TwoCover}_S(\\mathcal U,X) \\leftrightarrow \\mathcal U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\forall a,b\\in X\\;\\exists U\\in\\mathcal U\\;(a\\in U\\land b\\in U)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A 2-cover is a cover family in which every two-point subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> is contained in some member of the family.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-cover","status":"resolved","id":"a2427ac4523911c5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cover]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X$ (set, see [[58-df-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cover","status":"resolved","id":"a2427ac4523911c5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal U \\subseteq \\mathcal P(X)$ (cover family, see [[58-df-cover]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U \\subseteq \\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TwoCover}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}2\\text{-}cover} \\vdash \\mathrm{TwoCover}_S(\\mathcal U,X) \\leftrightarrow \\mathcal U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\forall a,b\\in X\\;\\exists U\\in\\mathcal U\\;(a\\in U\\land b\\in U)","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":740,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-97","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-2-cover.md|58-df-2-cover]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["a2427ac4523911c5","65d9a1e690c32aad"]}